Here at The Ridgeline Hotel and Conference Center in Estes Park, catering special events is one of our specialties. Whether you’re planning a meeting, convention, corporate retreat, or wedding, The Ridgeline caters with innovative style and service. From cost-effective buffets to elegant formal dinners, our award-winning Executive Chef and professional banquet staff provide our guests with inspired, crowd-pleasing meals. We personally prepare custom menus based on theme, entertainment, decor, and (most importantly) budget.
Nothing satisfies a crowd like a buffet, and at The Ridgeline, we have buffet catering options to suit every palate. Our breakfast buffets run the gamut from The Continental, featuring assorted danishes, turnovers, muffins, and fresh fruit, to the deluxe Big Thompson, which includes[ pancakes], French toast, ham steaks, and more. Lunch buffet options cover an array of cuisine from around the globe, ranging from the Orient[ Express] to the Taste of Italy to South of the Border. And when it comes to dinner buffets, we pull out all the stops! Just to name a few, you can choose from the Southern Hospital[ity] Buffet, featuring[ BBQ Rib]s, Southern Friend Chicken and Cajun Potato Salad; the Land and Sea Buffet, including Prime[ Rib] with Au Jus and Horseradish, and Honey Pecan Grilled Salmon; or The Rodeo Buffet, showcasing Chipotle Roasted Pork Loin and Slow-Braised[ BBQ] Brisket. Vegetarian options are also available, as well as a variety of a la carte selections.
If the occasion calls for something more formal, look no further than our Plated Banquet menus. Choose from Plated Lunch options ranging from Chicken Penne Alfredo to London Broil, Seared Salmon Filet to Hom[emade] Pot Roast, Italian Chef Salad to Chicken Fried Chicken, and more. Plated Dinners take things a step further by including coffee, hot tea, fresh green garden salad, warm rolls, and a Chef’s choice dessert. Dinner entrees include Chicken Piccata, Seafood Trio Primavera, Grilled NY Strip, Chicken Parmesan, Filet Mignon, and more!
