[You] will find LCC to be a church that shares a living, daring[ confidence] in[ God]'s grace.[ Liber]ated by our[ faith], we embrace you as a whole person -- questions, complexities and all! Join us as we do[ God]'s work in Christ's name for the[ life] of the world. We welcome all[ people] into[ disciples]hip with[ Jesus] Christ.
Our[ mission]:[ God] calls Lutheran[ Church] of the[ Cross] to welcome all[ people] into[ disciples]hip with[ Jesus Christ] through Prayer, Scripture Reading, Worship, Service in Christ's[ Name], Stewardship, and[ Hospitality].
