Air Products’ industrial gases are available in a variety of supply modes to match each customer’s requirements efficiently and cost-effectively. The company also offers gas handling equipment and technology, as well as process audits and troubleshooting, that can help metals processors optimize gas use, lower operating costs, maximize upt[ime], increase throughput, and improve product quality.
[Z]bigniew Zurecki, FASM and senior research associate at Air Products, will share new developments in atmosphere treatments as part of the �[�]New Directions and Opportunities in Heat Treating” panel session on Wednesday morning, October 21.[ In] addition, Air Products’ Dr. Liang He, principal application engineer, will present the results of original research titled �[�]Optimization of Protective Atmospheres for Annealing and Hardening Operations in[ Continuous] Furnaces” during the Atmosphere Technology Session on Wednesday afternoon.
