Radioactive noble gas is an important indicator of the presence of critical[ity] for it is created in[ f]ission reaction.
Gas discharged from the containment vessel which covers the pressure vessel is closely monitored by the �[�]gas management system.” The system analyses the kind and amount of each component in real[ time].
